  Google KMS route selection: the branch is entered when the configured
  `litellm.secret_manager_client` is recognised as a Google KMS client —
  either because the resolved key manager equals the Google KMS member of the
  project enum `litellm.proxy._types.KeyManagementSystem`, or because the
